{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46171","headline":"东阳罹乱後怀王慥使君五首 五 · 贯休","name":"东阳罹乱後怀王慥使君五首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不是龚黄覆育才，即须清苦远尘埃。\n无人与奏吾皇去，致乱唯因酷吏来。\n刳剥生灵爲事业，巧通毫谮作梯媒。\n令人转忆王夫子，一片真风去不回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46171.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46171","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}